# A hypothesis is the one obligation nobody decides. A machine condition has
# an evaluator, so a reader who wants its meaning reads the code; a
# hypothesis is named in the judgment and handed to the reader, and a name
# with no sentence behind it cannot be discharged by anyone.
#
# This is a lint rather than a loader refusal because the signature's
# annotations are not in its canonical document: the digest pins which
# obligations a judgment carries and not what they mean, so two
# implementations can agree on a signature and disagree on what it asks for.
# RUN: %python %S/Inputs/hypothesis_meaning_lint.py | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: {{^([0-9]+)/\1 carried hypotheses state what discharging them takes}}

# The gate's own evidence. A carried hypothesis whose annotation is deleted
# is the state this lint exists to catch, and it must fail rather than pass
# in silence — this is the defect that reached the tree once already.
# RUN: %python -c "import json,sys; d=json.load(open(sys.argv[1])); \
# RUN:   del d['annotations']['zkc.hyp.logup_multiplicities_honest']; \
# RUN:   json.dump(d, open(sys.argv[2],'w'))" \
# RUN:   %zkc-registry-dir/soundness-signature.json %t.stripped.json
# RUN: not %python %S/Inputs/hypothesis_meaning_lint.py %t.stripped.json 2>&1 \
# RUN:   | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=STRIPPED
# STRIPPED: zkc.hyp.logup_multiplicities_honest is carried by a rule and annotated nowhere

# And an annotation with no declaration behind it, which is the same drift
# from the other side: a sentence kept after the proposition it described
# was renamed reads as coverage and is not.
# RUN: %python -c "import json,sys; d=json.load(open(sys.argv[1])); \
# RUN:   d['annotations']['zkc.hyp.no_such_proposition']={'statement':'x'}; \
# RUN:   json.dump(d, open(sys.argv[2],'w'))" \
# RUN:   %zkc-registry-dir/soundness-signature.json %t.orphan.json
# RUN: not %python %S/Inputs/hypothesis_meaning_lint.py %t.orphan.json 2>&1 \
# RUN:   | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=ORPHAN
# ORPHAN: zkc.hyp.no_such_proposition is annotated and declared nowhere
